00:09:04.400 --> 00:09:04.900
&gt;&gt; DANIEL: Ja, gerne.

00:09:04.900 --> 00:09:05.700
&gt;&gt; MURAT: Bist du gespannt, was drin ist?

00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:06.100
&gt;&gt; DANIEL: Absolut.

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:06.800
&gt;&gt; MURAT: Okay, los!

00:09:12.700 --> 00:09:22.600
[Musik]

